  // ── Osysharp.Privacy · PrivacyRequestPane ──
  /// PrivacyRequestPane · a control's name for screen readers
  accessibleName "Privacy request" => "طلب خصوصية";
  /// PrivacyRequestPane · a button's label · at most ~34 characters
